**dbt Variant:** {{ dbt_variant }}

{%- if dbt_variant == 'dbt Projects on Snowflake' %}
Native dbt runs entirely within Snowflake, orchestrated by Tasks. Can materialize Dynamic Tables as part of the DAG.
